	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nec ego improbo maximopere institutum <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>in exhibendo pane et vino domini morituris<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Siehe oben S. 144, 1-145, 5.</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Cur autem <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>hoc non amplectamur, prolixius est, quam nunc permittant <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>negotia recensere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Annotavi quaedam in 2. cap. Actorum<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">«In Acta apostolorvm <persName ref="p495">Heinrychi Bvllingeri</persName> commentariorvm libri VI,» <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, August 1533 (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 43), s. f. 39v.-40r.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quae forsan proximis videbis nundinis <placeName ref="l157">Franckofordensibus</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ego <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>suspicor sanctum virum <persName ref="p2442">Oecolampadium</persName> istud<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Nämlich: das Abendmahl bei Kranken und Sterbenden, s. oben S. 144, 1-3.</note> pro tempore quidem <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>permisisse.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nam nulla alias poterit eius commonstrari necessitas.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Iuditium meum de usura et censibus iam olim <persName ref="p4091">Zuinglio</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nostro adhuc vivente prelo excusum est et in «Complanatione in leremiam» <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>34. cap. collaudatum<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><bibl source="b700">Z</bibl> XIV 621, 19-22.</note>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Extat in eo opere, quod germanica <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>lingua adversus catabaptistas aedidi<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Anhang zu <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Buch «Von dem unverschämten Frevel der Wiedertäufer» (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 28), Zürich 1531, f. CXLIIII-CLXXVIII; vgl. <bibl source="b221">Fast</bibl> 39.</note>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Agrestes nostri <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nunquam petierunt abrogari reformationem censuum, neque vero <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ipse senatus eius quicquam abrogavit, nisi quod exteris permis<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sum iam olim est, ut census iuxta tabularum tenorem <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>exigere possint.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">At nemini posthac conceditur, ut ullos <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>in agro nostro census emat nisi secundum praescriptam aequitatem.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Haec ego ex communi omnium relatione et optimatum sententia <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>scribo.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Si quid secus actum est, de quo vos audistis, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nos nescimus.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Haereses <placeName ref="l491">Argentorati</placeName> obortae plurimum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>terruerunt me<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Zu den täuferischen und weiteren sektiererischen Gruppen in <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> und das Vorgehen gegen sie an der Synode vom 10.-14. Juni 1533 s. oben S. 145, 12-15 und 171f, 13-21.</note>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Dominus exaltet nomen suum sanctum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vi<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ve et vale et pro nostra ecclesia ora.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">17. iulii 1533.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/><persName ref="p495">Hein.</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
